# L §7.6 item 2 (tally 2.1.6, issue #89): a declared day index of 0001-01-01..9999-12-31 holds 3 652 059 keys:
# LOAD-LIMIT (the built-in days take no limit). tally 2.1.5's refcore refused it REFCORE-NOT-YET (OverflowError).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ds = day 0001-01-01..9999-12-31

ask n: max(pos(k) for k in ds)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LIMIT index ds holds more than 1 000 000 keys (m.tally:9)
